# Code Optimization and Validation

## Introduction

This repository contains a collection of code optimization and validation tasks. Each task is designed to test your ability to optimize code, validate solutions, and ensure accuracy. The tasks are based on a variety of programming languages and problem domains.

## Getting Started

To get started, clone this repository to your local machine:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/code-optimization-and-validation.git
